          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "BOVINGDON             \tCHIPPERFIELD ROAD TL 00 SW \t\t\t\t\t(South side)                                        6/15                                    \tEast range of farm -                                      \t\tbuildings at                                        \t\tCross Farm GV                                      \tII Range of farm buildings. Late C16, minor alterations in C19. Timber frames on red brick sills. Dark weatherboarded with steep old red tile roofs. A range of tall barn-like buildings facing W. 4-bays S part has a rear aisle and open front with posts. Heavy jowled posts with braces to arcade plate and tie-beams of clasped purlin roof with inclined straight queen-posts. Squint butted scarf joint in wallplate. Longer N part not aisled and enclosed at front. Similar date and construction as S part. Central post to wide bays with staggered mid-height rail. Gabled opposed doorways in N part. Lower part at N end C19. (Roberts(1975)no.15). Listing NGR: TL0279502975"
    }
  ],
